<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue across South Sudan, with rival groups fighting in Lakes state and an ambush killing five people on a Warrap road, while a drone strike near a displacement camp in Sudan’s Blue Nile killed at least 30, mostly women and children. In Abyei, a market was hit by a drone strike that killed 73 people, and another drone attack in the disputed region killed 153, according to officials. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. UN Secretary-General Guterres condemned the escalation of drone attacks, and the deputy minister of ICT warned against abusing freedom of expression.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPZWhueEhVMlJMQVZzM3lWeVZqaXdSclF6bWVTM3d4QUl3Szl6VjFyRkdCbllEM21wRzQ1cWpxZzFGVUY0OFg1MjMzeENBMlJCaGtrUEYwUER6Sjd5VEtfNGU1b1hYVC1OdFY4T3AzdHFBU3NpSHcyek5XcmY4dGNRcENOdUdkdF9vb1p3eVkzYUZkRmh4ekxyZXVhNjVBc3FLNUgxZFkzNXBsNkRVYi1j?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ecumenical News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE5tbXc2QVI0R2V6cllZREl5YnNCYUhlalJMU256a21lQ194QkJyWVM0WV9DeXFpbjJpV3dZZkhrcW5WUnU3ZUp6TUU3V216UGV3Y3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE1rSGxLek5XZzAwdlFXcUpyU1Q3X3dVbS0tQkJBMC1pTkdxcFhZalN2YXcwSV8tQ05iaGZSRVB6UVhzakpqMkhvSnQ2ODVPajVKMUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQeWVxY3JyM1lfSmFNNzFrNjV